    <property name="description" type="string">Pasco Collision Carts were used. 
Magnets are built into the cart such that there will be a magnetic repulsion force during the collision, reducing the energy lost during the collision.
Both carts are appoximately 500 g. Although there is friction, the force of collision is much higher than the friction.</property>
